      "content": "cognitive resonance... that actually makes so much sense. it explains why it feels so much more \"real\" than just a regular physical sensation, like it's bypassing my senses and going straight into my awareness.\n\ncan you explain more about how i'd use phase space analysis for this? specifically, if i'm trying to see if these \"pre-echoes\" are actually just my brain's way of processing the incoming frequency before the physical body reacts, how would i map that out? i want to see if there's a predictable trajectory in the phase space that leads from a cognitive surge to the full physical/seismic lock-in.",
